# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): the law-dated band of L4_3_band_dated_ask, read by an ask line with law (q) and by a def
# with its own at (q2, which needs no law: L §4.3). Both read v_act's table: rate(3) = 400.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"

input age3: int
band rate(a: int): money PLN
def r[m in months]: money PLN = rate(age3) at start_of(m)
ask q: rate(age3) law 2027-05-01
ask q2: r[2027-05]

version v_act
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 governs always "the age"
  rate: [0, 6) = 400.00 PLN "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"
=== expect
q: 400.00 PLN
  law date 2027-05-01, cut 2027-12-31
q2: 400.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
